language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ A van lost a total number of coins; each stolen bag holds one of the given coin counts, so count the bags stolen of each type to make the total.
given total_coins_lost : int(0..)
given coin_numbers_dim1 : int(1..)
given coin_numbers : matrix indexed by [int(1..coin_numbers_dim1)] of int(1..)
find bags : matrix indexed by [int(1..coin_numbers_dim1)] of int(0..total_coins_lost)

branching on [bags]

such that
$ the bags stolen of each type hold, together, exactly the total number of coins lost
(sum i : int(1..coin_numbers_dim1) . bags[i] * coin_numbers[i]) = total_coins_lost
